⍝ 03 · FizzBuzz, two ways: with array operations and with a loop
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/03-fizzbuzz.apls

n←⍳15

⍝ Array version: choose a label per number with no loop.
⍝ (1+(0=3|n)+2×0=5|n) is 1 plain, 2 Fizz, 3 Buzz, 4 FizzBuzz
fb←{(1+(0=3|⍵)+2×0=5|⍵)⊃(⍕⍵)'Fizz' 'Buzz' 'FizzBuzz'}¨n
⎕←'array version:' ⋄ ⎕←fb

⍝ Loop version, with a control structure.
⎕←'loop version:'
:For i :In n
    :Select 0=3 5|i
    :Case 1 1 ⋄ ⎕←'FizzBuzz'
    :Case 1 0 ⋄ ⎕←'Fizz'
    :Case 0 1 ⋄ ⎕←'Buzz'
    :Else ⋄ ⎕←i
    :EndSelect
:EndFor
